<title>USA: Coca-Cola making $60 mln Zimbabwe investment.</title>
<headline>Coca-Cola making $60 mln Zimbabwe investment.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coca-Cola said early Wednesday that it would begin a $60 million capital investment program in Zimbabwe.</p>
<p>The company said the goal is to double its business in Zimbabwe over the next four years, a move that includes upgrading Zimbabwe's five Coca-Cola plants.</p>
</text>
